  "ingredients": [
    "15 ounces ricotta cheese",
    "1.75 cups white sugar",
    "0.5 pound butter",
    "2 eggs",
    "2 tablespoons vanilla extract",
    "4 cups all-purpose flour, or more as needed",
    "1 teaspoon baking powder",
    "1 teaspoon baking soda",
    "1.5 cups confectioners' sugar",
    "5 tablespoons milk",
    "1 teaspoon almond extract",
    "0.25 cup colored candy sprinkles"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease or line cookie sheets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/np2ZUF3UPbv08J48ftmUzS6236o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-11067-ricotta-cookies-ii-VAT-step-01-b1bbef43ef9c4471846514669f8c10ff.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11067/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine ricotta, sugar, butter, eggs, and vanilla extract in a large bowl; beat with an electric mixer until smooth and creamy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ND6_dDtqiIUmmSMsjRiiblyXS0A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-11067-ricotta-cookies-ii-VAT-step-02-570c870c05094f45acef83d31e1f3476.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11067/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour, baking powder, and baking soda; blend into ricotta mixture, mixing in additional flour if needed to form a workable dough.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ITF3S6zR9YEaGjTKW5RlRATPi_s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-11067-ricotta-cookies-ii-VAT-step-03-eb4a73b5281b4172aa18887ccf3f733b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11067/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll dough into walnut-sized balls and place 2 inches apart onto prepared cookie sheets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6fOyYNXd_Wm9akqrHThTjEG6kd0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-11067-ricotta-cookies-ii-VAT-step-04-11d531c49f594c9e97da801f723d017a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11067/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until edges are golden, about 8 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4FqBvMoEY8Xkyg7PFg7shMTRpxM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-11067-ricotta-cookies-ii-VAT-step-05-f2d2e9bd4c3541f48c6e8876c087e8ce.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11067/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the glaze: Mix confectioners' sugar, milk, and almond extract together until smooth. Spoon over warm cookies, and sprinkle with colored candy sprinkles.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
